@startuml D1_Guest_Patient_Auth
left to right direction
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 28
skinparam ranksep 38
skinparam Padding 8

actor Guest
actor Patient
Guest <|-- Patient

rectangle OrcaXCare {

  usecase "View Portal Home\n[UC-1]" as UC1
  usecase "Search Doctors\n[UC-1.1]" as UC11
  usecase "View Doctor Public Profile\n[UC-1.1.1]" as UC111
  usecase "View Doctor Reviews\n[UC-1.1.2]" as UC112
  usecase "View Featured Doctors\n[UC-1.2]" as UC12
  usecase "Locate Branch\n[UC-1.3]" as UC13

  usecase "Register Patient Account\n[UC-2]" as UC2
  usecase "Verify Email Address\n[UC-2.1]" as UC21
  usecase "Resend Verification Email\n[UC-2.2]" as UC22

  usecase "View Patient Dashboard\n[UC-3]" as UC3
  usecase "Profile Management\n[UC-3.1]" as UC31
  usecase "View Own Profile\n[UC-3.1.1]" as UC311
  usecase "Update Own Profile\n[UC-3.1.2]" as UC312
  usecase "Upload Profile Avatar\n[UC-3.1.3]" as UC313
  usecase "Change Password\n[UC-3.1.4]" as UC314

  usecase "Reset Forgotten Password\n[UC-4]" as UC4
  usecase "Log In\n[UC-5]" as UC5
  usecase "Log Out\n[UC-6]" as UC6
}

Guest --> UC1
Guest --> UC2
Guest --> UC5

Patient --> UC3
Patient --> UC6

UC11 ..> UC1 : <<extend>>
UC111 ..> UC11 : <<extend>>
UC112 ..> UC111 : <<extend>>
UC12 ..> UC1 : <<extend>>
UC13 ..> UC1 : <<extend>>

UC21 ..> UC2 : <<include>>
UC22 ..> UC2 : <<extend>>
UC22 ..> UC5 : <<extend>>

UC3 ..> UC5 : <<include>>
UC6 ..> UC5 : <<include>>
UC4 ..> UC5 : <<extend>>

UC31 ..> UC3 : <<extend>>
UC311 ..> UC31 : <<include>>
UC312 ..> UC31 : <<extend>>
UC313 ..> UC31 : <<extend>>
UC314 ..> UC31 : <<extend>>

UC1 -[hidden]down-> UC2
UC2 -[hidden]down-> UC3
UC5 -[hidden]left-> UC4

note bottom of UC3
  Entry point for Patient features
  (see Diagram D2: UC-7 ~ UC-15)
end note

@enduml
